      "created": 1791050013076,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rate limiting login attempts\nEmail verification and password reset\nSign up reveals whether an email has an account\n   (fixed by email verification)\nSession ids are stored as-is (later: store a hash)\nLogged-in page load: fetching the current game\n   from the server (not drawn yet)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
